msgid ""
"This path is intended for advanced users who need to manage the user-space "
"software stack themselves. You can install on an existing Linux host or "
"start from a minimal Linux container."
msgstr "此路径适用于需要自行管理用户空间软件栈的高级用户。您可以在现有的Linux主机上安装，或从最小的Linux容器开始。"

msgid "???+ important \"Verify NNAL separately\""
msgstr "???+ important \"单独验证NNAL\""

msgid ""
"The vLLM Ascend runtime requires NNAL (Ascend Neural Network Acceleration "
"Library). The NNAL package is typically named `Ascend-cann-nnal_...run`."
msgstr "vLLM Ascend运行时需要NNAL（昇腾神经网络加速库）。NNAL包通常命名为`Ascend-cann-nnal_...run`。"

