msgstr "<span id=\"installation-base-environment\"></span>"

msgid ""
"#### Install CANN manually {: #installation-base-environment-install-cann }"
msgstr "#### 手动安装 CANN {: #installation-base-environment-install-cann }"

msgid ""
"The commands above use the default CANN and NNAL installation paths. If you "
"install either component in a non-default directory, source the "
"corresponding `set_env.sh` from the actual installation directory. Refer to "
"the [CANN installation resources](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) to"
" complete the installation."
msgstr ""
"上述命令使用默认的 CANN 和 NNAL 安装路径。如果将任一组件安装到非默认目录，请加载实际安装目录下对应的 `set_env.sh`。请参阅 "
"[CANN 安装资源](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)完成安装。"

msgid ""
"#### Install vLLM and vLLM Ascend {: #installation-base-environment-install "
"}"
msgstr ""
